    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0299" n="41" xml:id="pg41"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/2291</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Roumania, Servia, and Bulgaria</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Vopicka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-07T15:00:00+01:44">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 7, 1915, 3 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received June 8, 7 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Roumanian Government, influenced by recent Russian reverses, may remain neutral.
                    It is questionable now whether Roumania will join the Quadruple Entente even if
                    its demands are granted.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
